  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "2210001",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Huai'an",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "221000101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "221000101": {
            "id": "221000101",
            "speakerId": 2202,
            "speakerName": "Huai'an",
            "text": "*sigh* Whatever am I going to do...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "221000102"
            ]
          },
          "221000102": {
            "id": "221000102",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What's wrong?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "221000103"
            ]
          },
          "221000103": {
            "id": "221000103",
            "speakerId": 2202,
            "speakerName": "Huai'an",
            "text": "This location... It's a real challenge to run an inn here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "221000104"
            ]
          },
          "221000104": {
            "id": "221000104",
            "speakerId": 2202,
            "speakerName": "Huai'an",
            "text": "Dihua Marsh means lots of Silvergrass, and where treasure lies, monsters will follow.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "221000105"
            ]
          },
          "221000105": {
            "id": "221000105",
            "speakerId": 2202,
            "speakerName": "Huai'an",
            "text": "We're lucky that the Millelith cleared most of them out of the area. Since then it's mostly been fine.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "221000106"
            ]
          },
          "221000106": {
            "id": "221000106",
            "speakerId": 2202,
            "speakerName": "Huai'an",
            "text": "But inexplicably, they seem to have made something of a resurgence recently.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "221000107"
            ]
          },
          "221000107": {
            "id": "221000107",
            "speakerId": 2202,
            "speakerName": "Huai'an",
            "text": "I know they would never come anywhere near the inn, but there's no denying they're an eyesore. And if even I think so, I can guarantee my customers will too.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "221000108"
            ]
          },
          "221000108": {
            "id": "221000108",
            "speakerId": 2202,
            "speakerName": "Huai'an",
            "text": "Are you free to help? It would be great if you could deal with any nearby monsters for me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "221000111",
              "221000112"
            ]
          },
          "221000111": {
            "id": "221000111",
            "speakerId": 2202,
            "speakerName": "Huai'an",
            "text": "Haha... Ah, I must say I do find your forthrightness refreshing...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "221000114"
            ]
          },
          "221000114": {
            "id": "221000114",
            "speakerId": 2202,
            "speakerName": "Huai'an",
            "text": "Anyway. I'm not exactly thrilled to be begging a guest for help like this.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "221000115"
            ]
          },
          "221000115": {
            "id": "221000115",
            "speakerId": 2202,
            "speakerName": "Huai'an",
            "text": "But please be assured that you will be well compensated for your trouble.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "221000116"
            ]
          },
          "221000116": {
            "id": "221000116",
            "speakerId": 2202,
            "speakerName": "Huai'an",
            "text": "Best of luck, and thank you."
          },
          "221000112": {
            "id": "221000112",
            "speakerId": 2202,
            "speakerName": "Huai'an",
            "text": "Frankly, yes, their irksome presence is the biggest problem they pose.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "221000113"
            ]
          },
          "221000113": {
            "id": "221000113",
            "speakerId": 2202,
            "speakerName": "Huai'an",
            "text": "But some people, such as a certain young gentleman obsessed with peace and quiet, find that simply intolerable. And when something upsets him, it usually ends up upsetting the rest of Dihua Marsh too..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2210002",
      "subQuestName": "Clear out nearby monsters",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "221000201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "221000201": {
            "id": "221000201",
            "speakerId": 2202,
            "speakerName": "Huai'an",
            "text": "How's it coming along? All clear?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "221000202"
            ]
          },
          "221000202": {
            "id": "221000202",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Not yet.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "221000203"
            ]
          },
          "221000203": {
            "id": "221000203",
            "speakerId": 2202,
            "speakerName": "Huai'an",
            "text": "Alright, well there's no rush. They tend to keep their distance so they don't pose a huge threat.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "221000204"
            ]
          },
          "221000204": {
            "id": "221000204",
            "speakerId": 2202,
            "speakerName": "Huai'an",
            "text": "But if one of the blind ones happened to lose its way and end up disrupting that young gentleman's peace and quiet...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "221000205"
            ]
          },
          "221000205": {
            "id": "221000205",
            "speakerId": 2202,
            "speakerName": "Huai'an",
            "text": "It might well plunge all of Dihua Marsh into a mad panic. More to the point, the inn would see no business until things finally quietened down."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2210003",
      "subQuestName": "Report back to Huai'an",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "221000301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "221000301": {
            "id": "221000301",
            "speakerId": 2202,
            "speakerName": "Huai'an",
            "text": "How's it coming along? All clear?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "221000302"
            ]
          },
          "221000302": {
            "id": "221000302",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "All clear.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "221000303"
            ]
          },
          "221000303": {
            "id": "221000303",
            "speakerId": 2202,
            "speakerName": "Huai'an",
            "text": "Great. Thanks a lot.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "221000304"
            ]
          },
          "221000304": {
            "id": "221000304",
            "speakerId": 2202,
            "speakerName": "Huai'an",
            "text": "As promised, here's your payment.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "221000305"
            ]
          },
          "221000305": {
            "id": "221000305",
            "speakerId": 2202,
            "speakerName": "Huai'an",
            "text": "Fingers crossed we're in the clear for a while now...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "221000306"
            ]
          },
          "221000306": {
            "id": "221000306",
            "speakerId": 2202,
            "speakerName": "Huai'an",
            "text": "Pardon? Who's the young gentleman? ...That's a question for the boss."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}